Z||000004||Haze_Performance||11-30-2000||02:52 AM||||Your asking about the gauges Not the covers right??<P>If so you can buy a 120mph speedo culster from any year and put it in your 84. Dont forget you will lose your oil press. gauge from the stock one unless you put in the Aux. gauges on the radio pod.<P>Youll have to recalibrate the tach to work in the 4cyl.<P><BR>Look here for the info:<BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/MotorCity/Garage/5007/fiero_osg/mod.speedo.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/MotorCity/Garage/5007/fiero_osg/mod.speedo.html</A>  <P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/goodlogo1_1.gif">   <BR><B>"AHHHHH!!! All Fiero's don't start on fire you BONEHEAD!!"</B>||||reg||10
